## MTECH OS — variant ya Kali Linux
##   Msingi: kali-linux-core + desktop XFCE + zana za mtaalamu
##   Jenga:  ./mtech-os/kali/build-iso.sh

## Live images always want these
kali-linux-core
kali-desktop-live

## Desktop (GUI ya Linux ambayo MTECH Shell inaifunga)
kali-desktop-xfce
xfce4-terminal

## Zana za mtaalamu (computer, mtandao, usalama)
kali-linux-default
nmap wireshark netcat-openbsd john hashcat sqlmap hydra metasploit
bloodhound.py impacket responder bettercap
binwalk foremost volatility3 autopsy
gobuster dirb nikto wpscan whatweb

## Kernel + headers (module ya /dev/mtech na eBPF)
linux-headers-amd64
bpfcc-tools bpftool clang llvm libbpf-dev

## Akili ya MTECH (agent + GUI)
python3 python3-pip python3-venv python3-dev
python3-pil
curl git wget unzip xz-utils file

## Udhibiti wa GUI na vision
xdotool wmctrl scrot xclip imagemagick
pulseaudio-utils
## Kumbuka: Ollama + Qwen 2.5 VL 3B zinawekwa na hook/firstboot (hazipo kwenye repos za Kali)
